	<section_number>1-227</section_number>
	<catch_line>Number</catch_line>
	<text>
		A word used in the singular includes the plural and a word used in the plural includes the singular.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1919, § 5; Code 1950, § 1-13; 1950, p. 22, § 1-13.15; 2005, c. 839.</history>
</law>
